  "body": "Coastal Luxury in the Prestigious Macleans Zone\r\n\r\nWelcome to 329A Bucklands Beach Road - a beautifully crafted, standalone residence combining contemporary luxury, exceptional space and flexible family living in one of East Auckland’s most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nThe vendor is committed to selling, creating an outstanding opportunity for families seeking a substantial new home within the sought-after Macleans College zone.\r\n\r\nDesigned for Modern and Extended Families\r\nArranged across two generous levels, the home offers six bedrooms, multiple living spaces and excellent separation.\r\nThe ground floor features two bedrooms, a spacious living area and a full bathroom - an ideal arrangement for extended family, teenagers, guests or working from home.\r\nUpstairs, you will find four further bedrooms, an additional family lounge and beautifully finished bathrooms, including a private master ensuite plus extra ensuite There is plenty of space for everyone to relax, entertain and enjoy their own privacy.\r\n\r\nPremium Location and Top School Zones\r\nEnjoy an easy walk to Bucklands Beach Intermediate and zoning for the highly sought-after Macleans College.\r\nHighland Park Shopping Centre, Pak’nSave, local cafés, parks, Eastern Beaches and Half Moon Bay Marina are all only minutes away, making everyday family life remarkably convenient.\r\nMulti generations families six-bedroom homes in this prestigious school zone are rarely available—and the vendor’s motivation means this opportunity should not be missed.\r\n\r\nThe instructions are clear: this property must be sold. Inspect without delay and make your interest known.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing or visit the next open home.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
